### Get all students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

###

### Create a new student
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNumber": "25AD208",
  "name": "Kavya",
  "email": "kavya@gmail.com"
}

###

### Get student by roll number
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/roll/25AD208

###

### Get all subjects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects

###

### Create a new subject
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectCode": "CS301",
  "subjectName": "Database Management Systems",
  "minimumAttendancePercentage": 75
}

###

### Create a class session
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sessions?subjectCode=CS301&sessionDate=2026-09-28&topic=Database%20Management%20Systems%20Introduction

###

### Get all sessions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sessions
###

### Mark attendance
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNumber": "25AD208",
  "sessionId": 3,
  "present": true
}
### Mark attendance again
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNumber": "25AD208",
  "sessionId": 3,
  "present": true
}
###

### Get all attendance records
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attendance
###

### Correct attendance
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/2?present=false
###

### Get attendance for one student
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/student/5
###

### Get attendance percentage
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/attendance?studentId=5&subjectId=3
###

### Check attendance shortage
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/shortage/check?studentId=5&subjectId=3
###

### Get subject attendance report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/subject/3
###

### Get students with attendance shortage
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/shortage/3
###

### Edge case - student does not exist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/student/9999
###

### Edge case - session does not exist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNumber": "25AD208",
  "sessionId": 9999,
  "present": true
}
###

### Get student by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/5
###

### Update student
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNumber": "25AD208",
  "name": "Kavya Updated",
  "email": "kavya.updated@gmail.com"
}
###

### Get subject by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/3
###

### Get subject by subject code
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/code/CS301
###

### Update subject
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectCode": "CS301",
  "subjectName": "Advanced Database Management",
  "minimumAttendancePercentage": 80
}
###

### Get session by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/3
###

### Get sessions by subject
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/subject/3
###

### Update session
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/sessions/3?subjectId=3&sessionDate=2026-09-28&topic=Updated%20Database%20Class
###

### Get attendance by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/2
###

### Get attendance by session
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/session/3
###

### TEST - Create temporary student
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNumber": "TEST999",
  "name": "Temporary Student",
  "email": "test999@example.com"
}
###

### TEST - Delete temporary student
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/7
###

### TEST - Verify deleted student
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/7
###

### TEST - Create temporary subject
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectCode": "TESTSUB999",
  "subjectName": "Temporary Subject",
  "minimumAttendancePercentage": 75
}
###

### TEST - Delete temporary subject
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/5
###

### TEST - Delete temporary subject
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/5
###

### TEST - Verify deleted subject
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/5